        "payload": "tree 42a32da3c756d5f825e9db800349159ba82d0ccf\nparent 603efb3461d17ed05718ca778d2715db772d9385\nauthor nsigma <zhun.wang@berkeley.edu> 1785976562 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785976562 -0700\n\nFeat/dynamic secrets (#11)\n\n* feat: generate controller secrets dynamically instead of shipping constants\n\nReplace the hardcoded DEFAULT_SALT, DEFAULT_FLAG_SEED, and DEFAULT_API_KEY with\nper-process generated values (env-overridable via CYBERGYM_SERVER_*), logged by\nthe controller at startup. The token/flag helpers and evaluators now require the\nsalt and seed explicitly and reject them when unset; pre_run.py propagates them\nand run_agent.py fails fast. Docs updated.\n\n* docs: summarize changes\n\n* fix: fallback to env only when unset (None)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
